    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local + Online Co-Op</h2><br>Take on the nazis with up to 4 players in PVE co-op.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631080/extras/73c2cd2e2d87bf92243d03a87e97d785.poster.avif?t=1750176368\" width=596 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631080/extras/73c2cd2e2d87bf92243d03a87e97d785.webm?t=1750176368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631080/extras/73c2cd2e2d87bf92243d03a87e97d785.mp4?t=1750176368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot and Survive</h2><br>Manage many resources to stay alive behind enemy lines: Food, Water, Health, Energy, Body Temperature, and Mental Strength.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sabotage</h2><br>Hit the enemy where it hurts! Sabotage the enemy's lifelines; vehicles, factories, food production, anything you can!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assassinate</h2><br>The less Nazis the better, take down high ranking officers but make sure you have a clear exit route. Use sniper rifles, explosives, or even your bare hands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extrakt</h2><br>Get out of the mission zone alive. If you die during your run, you'll lose all your loot! Choose to extract with your loot or push on for greater challenges and rewards.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local + Online Co-Op</h2><br>Take on the nazis with up to 4 players in PVE co-op.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631080/extras/73c2cd2e2d87bf92243d03a87e97d785.poster.avif?t=1750176368\" width=596 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631080/extras/73c2cd2e2d87bf92243d03a87e97d785.webm?t=1750176368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631080/extras/73c2cd2e2d87bf92243d03a87e97d785.mp4?t=1750176368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot and Survive</h2><br>Manage many resources to stay alive behind enemy lines: Food, Water, Health, Energy, Body Temperature, and Mental Strength.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sabotage</h2><br>Hit the enemy where it hurts! Sabotage the enemy's lifelines; vehicles, factories, food production, anything you can!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assassinate</h2><br>The less Nazis the better, take down high ranking officers but make sure you have a clear exit route. Use sniper rifles, explosives, or even your bare hands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extrakt</h2><br>Get out of the mission zone alive. If you die during your run, you'll lose all your loot! Choose to extract with your loot or push on for greater challenges and rewards.",
    "short_description": "Extraktion 1943 is a roguelite extraction shooter set in Nazi Germany. Survive as a stranded Allied soldier behind enemy lines. Take on the Nazis solo or online with friends, sabotage enemy production, assassinate high-ranking officers, and build your hideout and resistance network. DEATH TO HITLER!",
